      "textEn": "277\n\nThey have started to become visible. We can think about what kind of downfall human civilization will face by the end of Kali Yuga.\nWhat kind of degradation will it attain? Undoubtedly, no such wise man will remain who can understand God and our relationships with Him. In other words, if we want to say, we can say that all humans will become like animals. At that time, to reform society, Lord Krishna will appear as the Kalki avatar. Their\ntask will be the ultimate killing of the atheists, because ultimately Vishnu or Krishna is the real savior. When the so-called king and the ministers of the state spread disorder, then God incarnates and\nbrings order. Shri Krishna says in the Bhagavad Gita—Yada Yada Hi Dharmasya Glenirbhavati Bharata. Undoubtedly, it takes many years, but the rule is that when the king or minister does not follow the proper rules, then nature punishes in the form of war, famine, etc. Therefore, if they are not familiar with the ultimate\npurpose of life, then they should not take the burden of ruling the people.\nIn reality, every\nThe supreme master of every object is Lord Vishnu. He is the caretaker of everyone. King, father, and guardian, these are\nrepresentatives of Lord Vishnu, upon whom the responsibility of maintaining order and keeping the order intact\nhas been entrusted. Therefore, it is the duty of the king to keep the subjects in such a way that they\nare ultimately able to have knowledge of life's purpose. They do not know the selfish path, Vishnu. Unfortunately, neither the king, nor\nthe public knows that the ultimate purpose of life is to know Lord Vishnu and to reach Him. In the absence of this knowledge, every person lives in ignorance, and in the entire society, there is an abundance of exploiters and the exploited. When the earth is the moving and unmoving,\nAnd the knowledge is the devotion, and the origin is eternal.\nThat which is beyond is the root of other actions.\nIt is not to be explained, but